## Bootstrap Stamp

After every bootstrap (new or re-bootstrap), write these two files:

**`.bootstrap`** (get the timestamp from `date '+%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S'`):

```
skill: python-bootstrap
date: YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS
```

**`.bootstrap-skill`**: Full verbatim copy of `~/.claude/skills/python-bootstrap/SKILL.md` at time of bootstrap.

Both files are committed to git. Together they answer: "what tooling standard was this project last aligned to, and when?"

